sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant API as A05 FastAPI
    participant JWT as JWT verifier
    participant OPA as Local OPA
    participant DB as SQLite approval store
    participant LOG as JSONL audit
    participant M as Finance approver
    participant SIM as Simulated payment handler

    Note over C,SIM: Finance payment workflow. The generic /tools/execute path returns REQUIRE_APPROVAL without creating an approval.
    C->>API: Payment request with bearer token
    API->>JWT: Verify token and derive identity
    alt Invalid token or key unavailable
        JWT-->>API: Reject or unavailable
        API-->>C: 401 or 503, no execution
    else Identity verified
        API->>OPA: Evaluate agent, payment.create, erp.payments and arguments
        alt OPA error or DENY
            OPA-->>API: DENY
            API-->>C: Not executed
        else PERMIT
            OPA-->>API: PERMIT
            API->>LOG: Append authorization event before action
            LOG-->>API: Recorded or write failure
            opt Audit recorded
                API->>SIM: Simulate payment
                SIM-->>API: Simulated result
                API->>LOG: Append execution outcome
                API-->>C: Return result
            end
        else REQUIRE_APPROVAL
            OPA-->>API: REQUIRE_APPROVAL
            API->>DB: Persist PENDING approval and CREATED event
            DB-->>API: Approval ID and expiry
            API-->>C: PENDING_APPROVAL
            M->>API: Decide with finance_approver identity
            API->>DB: Persist APPROVED or REJECTED and event
            DB-->>API: Decision status
            C->>API: Execute same operation and approval ID
            API->>OPA: Re-evaluate current policy
            alt Policy error or no longer requires approval
                OPA-->>API: Deny
                API-->>C: Not executed, approval not consumed
            else Still requires approval
                OPA-->>API: REQUIRE_APPROVAL
                API->>LOG: Append authorization event before consume
                LOG-->>API: Recorded or write failure
                opt Audit recorded
                    API->>DB: Atomically consume exact requester and digest
                    DB-->>API: CONSUMED or consume denied
                    opt Consumed
                        API->>SIM: Simulate payment
                        SIM-->>API: Simulated result
                        API->>LOG: Append execution outcome
                        API-->>C: Return result
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over DB,LOG: Diagram 05 shows audit failures, database outages, restart recovery, and the crash window after consumption.
